# User Roles, Features & Messaging Guide

This document outlines all available functionalities for different user roles and details the communication systems implemented in the application.

## 1. User Features Matrix

| Feature | Guest / Free User | Pro User |
| :--- | :---: | :---: |
| **Labellisation & Annuaire** | View & Filter labels and companies | View & Filter labels and companies |
| **Journal (News)** | Read standard articles | Read all articles (incl. Premium) |
| **Médiatique (Multimedia)** | Watch videos & listen to podcasts | Watch videos & listen to podcasts |
| **Kiosque Digital** | Preview editions only | **Full access & PDF Downloads** |
| **Library** | Prompted to login | Save labels & articles for later |
| **Ad-Free Experience** | Sees ads | Sees ads (unless toggle implemented) |

### Detailed Actions: Normal User
- **Discovery**: Search for companies in the Directory by sector or region.
- **Labels**: Explore audit criteria and normative architectures (ISO, ESG, etc.).
- **Newsletter**: Subscribe to thematic newsletters.
- **Support**: Access pricing plans and basic company information.
- **Account**: Update profile and reset password.

### Detailed Actions: Pro User
- **Premium Intelligence**: Access deep-dive ESG analyses restricted by paywalls.
- **Kiosk Access**: Open and download monthly review PDF reports.
- **Elite Networking**: Full visibility into certified entity scores (Social & Governance).

---

## 2. Administrator Capabilities

The Admin Dashboard is the nerve center of the platform, allowing full control over all content.

### Content Management (CRUD)
- **FA TV & Podcasts**: Manage multimedia content with genre/sector categorization.
- **Journal Editorial**: Publish news, tag as "Premium", and manage featured stories.
- **Kiosque Update**: Upload monthly PDF editions and set featured covers.
- **Flash Info**: Create and prioritize high-visibility news tickers.

### Governance & Data
- **Labels & Criteria**: Define the scoring architecture for various standards.
- **Registry (Companies)**: Certify new entities, update their ESG scores, and manage their status.
- **Audit Workflow**: Configure the multi-step validation process for certifications.

### Monetization & Reach
- **Ad Manager**: Deploy Top, Sidebar, or Inline banners with target URLs and tracking.
- **Newsletter**: View subscription list (database level) and manage topics.
- **Subscriptions**: Manage user roles and upgrade users to PRO status.

---

## 3. Notifications & Messaging Systems

The app uses several channels to communicate with users:

### Real-time Feedback (Toasts)
- Immediate visual confirmation for actions like "Article Saved", "Login Failed", or "Subscription Successful".
- Error alerts when attempting to access PRO content as a free user.

### Newsletter System
- **Status**: Active.
- **Function**: Users can opt-in to specific interests (Finance, ESG, Tech).
- **Integration**: Backend records subscriptions for bulk email campaigns.

### Email Communication
- **System**: Integrated via SendGrid/Nodemailer.
- **Triggers**:
    - **Password Recovery**: Secure links for "Forgot Password".
    - **Account Verification**: (If enabled in auth settings).

### Note on Messaging
- **Internal Chat**: Not currently implemented.
- **Push Notifications**: Not currently implemented.
- **Support System**: Direct contact via pricing/contact links usually leads to external email.
